        <h1 class="hero__title"><span>Immigration remains Britain’s biggest issue as concern about climate change and the environment rises</span>
</h1>

                  <div class="hero__description">The August 2026 Ipsos Issues Index shows that immigration continues to be seen as the biggest issue facing Britain. Forty-two per cent of Britons name immigration as an important issue facing the country, relatively unchanged since last month. </div>
        
        
                  <div class="hero__date">
            <time datetime="02.09.26">02.09.26</time>
          </div>
        
